        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="erklaerung" xml:id="IIAs_19.lnote.de.1" n="1" source="#liebermann-erkl"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">3</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">105</biblScope><biblScope unit="column">2</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">Vgl. Gl</hi> unfrei 17 c. e. 19 b; Ordal 19. 22. Teilweise aus Q benutzt in Hn 59, 23</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude"><hi rend="italic">Cf. Gl</hi> unfrei 17 c. e. 19 b; Ordal 19. 22. Used in part, from Q, in Hn 59, 23</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="erklaerung" xml:id="IIAs_19.lnote.de.2" n="2" source="#liebermann-erkl"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">3</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">105</biblScope><biblScope unit="column">2</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">Über die Modernisierung des Praeteriti zum Praesens <hi rend="italic">s o.</hi> Einl. 1, Z. 5</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">On the modernization of the preterite into the present <hi rend="italic">see above</hi> Introduction 1, l. 5</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="erklaerung" xml:id="IIAs_19.lnote.de.3" n="3" source="#liebermann-erkl"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">3</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">105</biblScope><biblScope unit="column">2</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">Die Leibesstrafe absorbiert Busse und Strafgeld; Schreuer <hi rend="italic">Verbrechenskonk.</hi> 43. 263. Diese treten wieder ein, wenn Geisselung unterbleibt</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">The corporal punishment absorbs compensation and fine; Schreuer <hi rend="italic">Verbrechenskonk.</hi> 43. 263. These come into force again if the flogging is not carried out</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="erklaerung" xml:id="IIAs_19.lnote.de.4" n="4" source="#liebermann-erkl"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">3</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">105</biblScope><biblScope unit="column">2</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">Vgl. Gl</hi> Busse 4. g. 11 d. 13 b; Stand 13 b; Strafe 11 A</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude"><hi rend="italic">Cf. Gl</hi> Busse 4. g. 11 d. 13 b; Stand 13 b; Strafe 11 A</seg></note>
